{"id":"661922","name":"鸡肉蔬菜锅","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/661922/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡腿","amount":"2个"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"洋葱","amount":"适量"},{"name":"海鲜菇","amount":"适量"},{"name":"包菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"西兰花","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"鸡腿肉斩块后洗净。","img":"images/661922/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"加入适量玉米淀粉，老抽，蚝油。","img":"images/661922/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"抓拌均匀后适量花生油锁住水份。","img":"images/661922/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"蒜头去皮衣后切片。","img":"images/661922/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"洋葱洗净切细备用。","img":"images/661922/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"海鲜菇清洗干净备用。","img":"images/661922/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"胡萝卜洗净去皮切片。","img":"images/661922/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"西兰花洗净备用。","img":"images/661922/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"包菜手撕成块洗净。","img":"images/661922/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"锅中热油放入蒜片炒香。","img":"images/661922/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入洋葱炒出香味。","img":"images/661922/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入胡萝卜。","img":"images/661922/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"翻炒均匀。","img":"images/661922/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放入鸡腿肉。","img":"images/661922/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放入西兰花和海鲜菇。","img":"images/661922/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放入包菜。","img":"images/661922/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"盖上盖子小火煲。","img":"images/661922/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"中途勤翻动。","img":"images/661922/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"煲至所有配菜断生，少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/661922/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661922/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/661922/step_21.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}